# Creature Bond on Bot2's Elvish Mystic. Bot1 casts Stab on it: toughness 1 - 2 = -1, so it dies as a state-based action
# (CR 704.5f). The Aura deals damage equal to that toughness, which is less than 0, so 0 is used (CR 107.1b) and
# no damage is dealt (CR 120.8): Bot2 stays at 20.

